user_prompt_template:
Extract concepts from the following batch of {{N}} comments. Each comment has an `input_id` (you must echo it back) and a `text`.

Return a JSON object matching this exact schema:
```
{
  "results": [
    {
      "input_id": "<echoed string>",
      "extractions": [
        {
          "concept_key": "<lowercase_snake_case>",
          "display_label": "<short human-readable phrase, max 60 chars>",
          "target_type": "brand|product|category|behavior|keyword|event_type",
          "target_key": "<lowercase_snake_case>",
          "intent": "adoption|abandonment|complaint|praise|comparison|question|prediction",
          "polarity": -1 | 0 | 1,
          "extraction_confidence": <float 0..1>
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Batch:
{{batch_json}}
